{"4163350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mana Runner", "steam_appid": 4163350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4743630], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into <i>Mana Runner</i>, a retro-cyberpunk action RPG set in an alternate-history New Orleans, 1997.</strong><br>In this world, Half-Orcs, Elves, and Mana-powered magic exist alongside neon alleys, corporate sprawl, and back-alley tech dealers. Mega-corporations rule the city with ruthless control, and only those willing to work in the shadows can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Jake Gideon</strong>, a mercenary, data courier, and Mana Runner for hire. Your jobs take you deep into the underbelly of the city, where every alley hides a threat and every corporation hides a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a crew of skilled <strong>Runners</strong>, each with their own class, abilities, and combat roles; Hackers who crack digital defenses, Enforcers who punch through front lines, Mana Priests who channel destructive or healing magic, and many more. Build your team, upgrade your gear, and  take on missions that could solve a brutal murder and unravel a deadly conspiracy involving some of the cities most unscrupulous and ruthless characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163350/extras/bf455a0446ce5b15b098c42a17b91e75.poster.avif?t=1779220012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163350/extras/bf455a0446ce5b15b098c42a17b91e75.webm?t=1779220012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163350/extras/bf455a0446ce5b15b098c42a17b91e75.mp4?t=1779220012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",